#: ../../../gazebo_classic_migration.md:1
msgid "Gazebo Classic Migration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gazebo_classic_migration.md:3
msgid ""
"Gazebo was started in 2002. After over 15 years of development it was time "
"for a significant upgrade and modernization. This upgrade also provided the "
"opportunity to move away from a monolithic architecture to a collection of "
"loosely coupled libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gazebo_classic_migration.md:8
msgid ""
"These collection of libraries make up the new Gazebo. As a convention we "
"refer to older versions of Gazebo, those with release numbers like Gazebo 9 "
"and Gazebo 11 as \"Gazebo Classic\". Newer versions of Gazebo, formerly "
"called \"Ignition\", with lettered releases names like Harmonic, are "
"referred to as just \"Gazebo\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gazebo_classic_migration.md:15
msgid ""
"Since the name of the project has gone through two major changes, we highly "
"recommend you read the [history](https://gazebosim.org/about) of the project "
"as well as our [community post](https://community.gazebosim.org/t/a-new-era-"
"for-gazebo/1356) to have a better understanding of the terminology used on "
"this website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gazebo_classic_migration.md:23
msgid ""
"Here you'll find guides and resources for migrating existing Gazebo Classic "
"projects to the new Gazebo."
msgstr ""

